OVERVIEW

Exit Unknown is a fully offline game designed to respect your privacy. We are committed to protecting your data by not collecting any personal information in the first place.

---

DATA COLLECTION

We do not collect, store, process, or share any personal data from users.

Exit Unknown does not require account creation, login, or any form of personal information to play.

---

LOCAL DATA STORAGE

Any data created during gameplay (such as progress or settings) is stored locally on your device only. This data never leaves your device and is not accessible to us or any third parties.

---

NO ADS OR MONETIZATION

Exit Unknown is completely free to play:

* No advertisements
* No in-app purchases
* No subscriptions

We do not monetize your data in any way.

---

THIRD-PARTY SERVICES

Exit Unknown does not use:

* Analytics tools
* Advertising networks
* External SDKs
* Tracking technologies

No third parties have access to any user data.

---

DATA TRANSMISSION

Exit Unknown operates entirely offline and does not require an internet connection. No data is transmitted to any servers at any time.

---

USER RIGHTS

Because we do not collect or store personal data:

* There is no personal data to access, modify, or delete
* You maintain full control over any data stored locally on your device

If we ever introduce features that involve data collection in the future, users will have the right to access, update, or delete their personal information in accordance with applicable laws.

---

CHILDREN’S PRIVACY

Exit Unknown does not knowingly collect any personal information from children or any users.

---

SECURITY

Since no personal data is collected or transmitted, privacy risks are minimal. Any local data remains under your control on your device.

